    "objects": {
      "general": [
        {
          "properties": {
            "paragraphs": [
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "How to read this report",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI Semibold",
                      "fontSize": "18pt",
                      "color": "#1F1F1F"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "horizontalTextAlignment": "left"
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": " ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "8pt",
                      "color": "#1F1F1F"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "horizontalTextAlignment": "left"
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "The rule. ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI Semibold",
                      "fontSize": "12pt",
                      "color": "#1F1F1F"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "To win outright, a presidential candidate needs the most votes nationally and at least 25% of the votes in at least two-thirds of the states. We count 37 units (36 states plus the FCT) and use 24 as the default; 25 is offered as a stricter reading. This is our reading of section 134 of the Constitution, checked against an unofficial copy.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "12pt",
                      "color": "#1F1F1F"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "horizontalTextAlignment": "left"
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": " ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "8pt",
                      "color": "#1F1F1F"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "horizontalTextAlignment": "left"
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "What the numbers are. ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI Semibold",
                      "fontSize": "12pt",
                      "color": "#1F1F1F"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "2023 results per unit, reconciled from five secondary copies of INEC's declaration, because INEC's own state sheet is not public. PDP and NNPP state totals add up to INEC's national declaration with no adjustment; for APC and Labour they match because three disputed cells were chosen to make them match. The minor-candidates column is 4,858 votes too high nationally, and nobody can yet say where.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "12pt",
                      "color": "#1F1F1F"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "horizontalTextAlignment": "left"
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": " ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "8pt",
                      "color": "#1F1F1F"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "horizontalTextAlignment": "left"
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "What the simulator assumes. ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI Semibold",
                      "fontSize": "12pt",
                      "color": "#1F1F1F"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "Swing adds the same number of points in every unit of a zone. Supporter turnout changes only the candidate's own 2023 voters. Rivals gain or lose in proportion to their 2023 shares. No new candidates, mergers or boundary changes. It is a what-if tool, not a forecast: it says nothing about how likely a scenario is.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "12pt",
                      "color": "#1F1F1F"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "horizontalTextAlignment": "left"
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": " ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "8pt",
                      "color": "#1F1F1F"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "horizontalTextAlignment": "left"
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "What it does not claim. ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI Semibold",
                      "fontSize": "12pt",
                      "color": "#1F1F1F"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "It is not an electoral authority and not INEC's figures. It has no local-government detail. Small swings near 25% are within the data's uncertainty: for example, Tinubu's 2023 count of 29 rests on 96 votes in Adamawa.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "12pt",
                      "color": "#1F1F1F"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "horizontalTextAlignment": "left"
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": " ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "8pt",
                      "color": "#1F1F1F"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "horizontalTextAlignment": "left"
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Full method: docs/methodology.md. Data profile and gaps: docs/data-profile.md (both in the project repository).",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "10pt",
                      "color": "#505050"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "horizontalTextAlignment": "left"
              },
              {
